GoTube v3.0.4
=============

Version: 3.0.4
Release Date: 2026-04-14
Description: 自托管多平台视频下载工具 - 数据库化升级版

Key Features:
- Multi-platform video downloading (YouTube, Bilibili, X/Twitter, etc.)
- Web-based management interface
- SQLite + SQLAlchemy persistent storage
- Multi-user system with roles (admin, user, readonly)
- Deduplication using CRC32 file fingerprinting
- WebSocket progress tracking
- New login portal and user management UI

Tech Stack:
- Backend: Python 3.13 + FastAPI + SQLAlchemy
- Database: SQLite
- Auth: bcrypt password hashing
- Download Engine: yt-dlp
- Frontend: Vanilla JS
- Process Management: systemd

